      "widgets_values": [
        "A highly detailed, semi-realistic fantasy landscape of a vast mountain valley at golden hour. Towering snow-capped peaks with atmospheric haze in the distance, glacial snowmelt feeding a winding crystal-clear river that snakes through terraced green meadows dotted with wildflowers. Dense layered forests of pines, firs, and autumn-colored deciduous trees cover the rolling hillsides, with subtle mist drifting between the trees. In a sunlit clearing near the riverbank sits a meticulously crafted small wooden cottage with hand-hewn log walls, a steep shingled roof, smoke rising from a stone chimney, a little wooden bridge over a creek, wild garden beds, and stacked firewood. Beside the path stands a wooden flagpole with a flowing banner bearing a subtle data-engineering / Rust-programming motif (a small gear interwoven with a code bracket). Cinematic lighting, volumetric rays, hyper-detailed textures, rich depth of field, painterly yet semi-realistic rendering, epic wide-angle composition, 8k, highly intricate, matte-painting quality."
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
